    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jackbox-style party chaos collides with classic tabletop fantasy in <i>DungeonBox</i>, a phone-controlled RPG for 3-8 players. Type your boldest actions, vote for the funniest idea, and watch a quick-witted Dungeon Master weave the winning move into an ever-branching adventure packed with dramatic dice rolls, treasure, and mischief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast party pacing, lasting campaigns \u2013 Every round feels like a mini game show, while choices carry forward through full quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Phone-as-controller \u2013 Join instantly via QR or room code; no extra mobile app required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Vote-driven storytelling &amp; dice \u2013 Shape the narrative together, then test fate with digital d20s and cheeky items like Gold Dice or Potions of Confusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Streamer-friendly \u2013 Audience voting and Remote Play Together support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cJackbox\u201d is a trademark of Jackbox Games, Inc., and \u201cDungeons &amp; Dragons\u201d is a trademark of Wizards of the Coast, LLC. DungeonBox is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by either company.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jackbox-style party chaos collides with classic tabletop fantasy in <i>DungeonBox</i>, a phone-controlled RPG for 3-8 players. Type your boldest actions, vote for the funniest idea, and watch a quick-witted Dungeon Master weave the winning move into an ever-branching adventure packed with dramatic dice rolls, treasure, and mischief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast party pacing, lasting campaigns \u2013 Every round feels like a mini game show, while choices carry forward through full quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Phone-as-controller \u2013 Join instantly via QR or room code; no extra mobile app required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Vote-driven storytelling &amp; dice \u2013 Shape the narrative together, then test fate with digital d20s and cheeky items like Gold Dice or Potions of Confusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Streamer-friendly \u2013 Audience voting and Remote Play Together support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cJackbox\u201d is a trademark of Jackbox Games, Inc., and \u201cDungeons &amp; Dragons\u201d is a trademark of Wizards of the Coast, LLC. DungeonBox is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by either company.</p>",
